<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY SEPT TRADE DEFICIT $166 MLN - CEN. BANK.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY SEPT TRADE DEFICIT $166 MLN - CEN. BANK.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's foreign trade deficit</p>
<p>widened by $166 million in September, compared with a deficit</p>
<p>of $324 million in August, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH)</p>
<p>said in a statement on Friday.</p>
</text>
